{
  "name": "PDFflow",
  "bundle": "com.pdfflow.app",
  "repo": "reachneoagent-commits/pdfflow",
  "upstream_name": "PdfCraft",
  "_comment": "Every change to an upstream-owned file. Applied in order by rebrand/apply.py; see docs/UPSTREAM.md.",
  "edits": [
    {
      "file": "apps/pdfcraft/src/main.rs",
      "find": "\"ai.storyteller.pdfcraft\"",
      "replace": "\"com.pdfflow.app\""
    },
    {
      "file": "apps/pdfcraft/src/main.rs",
      "find": "} else { eframe::storage_dir(\"PdfCraft\") };",
      "replace": "} else { eframe::storage_dir(\"PDFflow\") };"
    },
    {
      "file": "crates/ui-egui/src/app/settings.rs",
      "find": "const FOLDER_NAME: &'static str = \"PdfCraft\";",
      "replace": "const FOLDER_NAME: &'static str = \"PDFflow\";"
    },
    {
      "file": "apps/pdfcraft/src/main.rs",
      "find": "\"PdfCraft\",",
      "replace": "\"PDFflow\","
    },
    {
      "file": "apps/pdfcraft/src/main.rs",
      "find": ".with_title(\"PdfCraft\")",
      "replace": ".with_title(\"PDFflow\")"
    },
    {
      "file": "apps/pdfcraft/src/main.rs",
      "find": "\"pdfcraft {}\"",
      "replace": "\"pdfflow {}\""
    },
    {
      "file": "apps/pdfcraft/src/main.rs",
      "find": "log::info!(\"PdfCraft {}, log file",
      "replace": "log::info!(\"PDFflow {}, log file"
    },
    {
      "file": "crates/ui-egui/src/platform/macos_association.rs",
      "find": "const BUNDLE_ID: &str = \"ai.storyteller.pdfcraft\";",
      "replace": "const BUNDLE_ID: &str = \"com.pdfflow.app\";",
      "why": "must match CFBundleIdentifier in Info.plist.in, or opening a quarantined PDF never recovers its PDFflow binding"
    },
    {
      "file": "crates/ui-egui/src/platform/macos_association.rs",
      "find": "62706c6973743030d30102030405065776657273696f6e54706174685f101062756e646c656964656e74696669657210005f101a2f4170706c69636174696f6e732f50646643726166742e6170705f101761692e73746f727974656c6c65722e7064666372616674080f171c2f314e0000000000000101000000000000000700000000000000000000000000000068",
      "replace": "62706c6973743030d30102030405065776657273696f6e54706174685f101062756e646c656964656e74696669657210005f101a2f4170706c69636174696f6e732f50646643726166742e6170705f100f636f6d2e706466666c6f772e617070080f171c2f314e0000000000000101000000000000000700000000000000000000000000000060",
      "why": "the test's captured binding, re-encoded with PDFflow's bundle id (same path and version)"
    },
    {
      "file": "packaging/macos/Info.plist.in",
      "find": "Copyright © the PdfCraft authors.",
      "replace": "Copyright © Reach Neo."
    },
    {
      "file": "packaging/macos/Info.plist.in",
      "find": "<string>ai.storyteller.pdfcraft</string>",
      "replace": "<string>com.pdfflow.app</string>"
    },
    {
      "file": "packaging/macos/Info.plist.in",
      "find": "PdfCraft",
      "replace": "PDFflow"
    },
    {
      "file": "packaging/macos/package.sh",
      "find": "PdfCraft",
      "replace": "PDFflow"
    },
    {
      "file": "packaging/windows/pdfcraft.wxs",
      "find": "Learning Machines LLC",
      "replace": "Reach Neo"
    },
    {
      "file": "packaging/windows/pdfcraft.wxs",
      "find": "https://getartcraft.com/apps/pdfcraft",
      "replace": "https://github.com/reachneoagent-commits/pdfflow"
    },
    {
      "file": "packaging/windows/pdfcraft.wxs",
      "find": "https://discord.gg/artcraft",
      "replace": "https://github.com/reachneoagent-commits/pdfflow"
    },
    {
      "file": "packaging/windows/pdfcraft.wxs",
      "find": "<Directory Id=\"CraftSuiteFolder\" Name=\"ArtCraft\">",
      "replace": "<Directory Id=\"CraftSuiteFolder\" Name=\"FlowApps\">"
    },
    {
      "file": "packaging/windows/pdfcraft.wxs",
      "find": "PdfCraft",
      "replace": "PDFflow"
    }
  ],
  "prepend": [
    {
      "file": "CLAUDE.md",
      "marker": "<!-- PDFflow (rebrand/apply.py) -->",
      "lines": [
        "<!-- PDFflow (rebrand/apply.py) -->",
        "# PDFflow",
        "",
        "This repository is **PDFflow**, a fork of PdfCraft. Read `docs/UPSTREAM.md` first. In short:",
        "",
        "- Never hand-edit a file that came from upstream to change branding, ids, links or icons: add the",
        "  change to `rebrand/brand.json` (or a patch in `rebrand/patches/`) and run `python3 rebrand/apply.py`,",
        "  so it survives the next upstream merge.",
        "- PDFflow's own files are `rebrand/`, `brand/`, `docs/UPSTREAM.md`, `README.md`,",
        "  `assets/header-*.png` and `.github/workflows/release.yml` / `windows-release.yml`.",
        "- Crate, binary and environment-variable names stay `pdfcraft*` / `PDFCRAFT_*`.",
        ""
      ]
    }
  ],
  "append": [
    {
      "file": "NOTICE",
      "marker": "PDFflow is a modified version",
      "lines": [
        "",
        "PDFflow",
        "",
        "PDFflow is a modified version of PdfCraft, made by Reach Neo as part of the FlowApps suite.",
        "It changes the name, icon, identifiers and links and removes the Discord and ArtCraft links;",
        "rebrand/brand.json and rebrand/patches/ list every change.",
        "PDFflow is not affiliated with or endorsed by the ArtCraft Team. The PDFflow name and mark",
        "(brand/, assets/app-icon/) are not covered by the license above."
      ]
    },
    {
      "file": ".gitattributes",
      "marker": "(rebrand/apply.py): files we replace whole",
      "lines": [
        "",
        "# PDFflow (rebrand/apply.py): files we replace whole keep our version in a merge.",
        "# Needs `git config merge.ours.driver true` once per clone (docs/UPSTREAM.md).",
        "README.md merge=ours",
        ".github/workflows/release.yml merge=ours",
        ".github/workflows/windows-release.yml merge=ours",
        "assets/app-icon/** merge=ours"
      ]
    },
    {
      "file": ".gitignore",
      "marker": "# FlowApps release builds",
      "lines": [
        "# FlowApps release builds and editor files",
        "/*.dmg",
        "/*.msi",
        "*.exe",
        "*.zip",
        ".vscode/",
        ".idea/",
        "*.swp",
        "*.swo"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
